                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A fun time killer game, requires matching two same color cells while also making sure cells don't age too much and go \"dark\", which causes them to corrupt other hit cells. There isn't an \"endgame\" to it, which fits this type of game very well, you just try to beat you and your friend's highscores. I got it a little cheaper, but i'd say it's worth the full $4 if you like time killers while waiting on whatever. Also, give the credits a view for some cell facts.",
